<title>USA: SCI Systems Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>SCI Systems Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.97		    $0.74</p>
<p> Net			 29,600		   22,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,480,000		1,200,000</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.80		    $1.24</p>
<p> Net			 54,700		   37,300</p>
<p> Revs		   2,900,000		2,100,000</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: EPS is on primary share basis.</p>
<p>On diluted basis, Q2 EPS was $0.88 vs $0.74 and six month EPS was $1.63 vs $1.24.</p>
